<title>SOUTH AFRICA: CRICKET-INDIA 29-3 AT CLOSE V SOUTH AFRICA (529-7 DEC).</title>
<headline>CRICKET-INDIA 29-3 AT CLOSE V SOUTH AFRICA (529-7 DEC).</headline>
<dateline>CAPE TOWN 1997-01-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>India were 29 for three in reply</p>
<p>to South Africa's first innings 529 for seven declared at the</p>
<p>close on second day of the second test on Friday.</p>
</text>
